{
 "verdict": "The recurring top-10 ranking is not live-eligible on any symbol or timeframe tested. It carries a small, genuinely out-of-sample amount of information - about 0.7 extra names of ten carrying into a disjoint period - and that information is worth approximately +0.015R per trade, which is inside the cost of being wrong about it.",
